      "Jeanette Grasselli Brown, Class of 2010"
    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Jeanette Grasselli Brown spent 38 years in industrial research, retiring as Director of Corporate Research for BP America after a career that included patents, publications, and national scientific honors. She later served higher education through Ohio University, the Ohio Board of Regents, and statewide teacher-success work, while remaining connected to Cleveland's Hungarian and civic communities."
    ]
